# Testing Functionality on TR Cast

## OOBE
* Launch TR Cast
* Display OOBE on the first launch of TR Cast

## Screenshot
* Launch TR Hub and check login status
* Launch TR Cast
* Select cloud streaming
* User can take a screenshot on the app

## Start Streaming
* Launch TR Hub and check login status
* Launch TR Cast
* Select cloud streaming
* User can start a stream on the app

## View cloud streaming on TR Portal
* Launch TR Portal
* Login into the TR Portal with "main" account
* Find and select the current device on TR Portal
* User can view the stream on the cloud portal with cloud streaming
* User can take a screenshot on the cloud portal
* User can pause the stream on the cloud portal
* User can resume the stream on the cloud portal
* User can close the stream on the cloud portal
* User can rejoin the stream on the cloud portal
* Launch another user TR Portal
* Login into the TR Portal with "second" account
* Find and select the current device on TR Portal
* User can view the stream on the cloud portal with cloud streaming

## Stop Streaming
* Launch TR Cast
* User can stop a stream on the app